{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も皆さんお疲れ様‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はラジオ頑張ってきましたよヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Wせいらと楽しかった(*´ω`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の反省点は次に活かすぞー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"罰ゲームはなにカナ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろラジオアップされてる頃かもー⁉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひ聞いてみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日は乃木坂浪漫の日‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくれた人ーヽ(^ω^)ﾉ⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな衣装で撮影"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま、まさに 狼に口笛を だわー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"狼好きだからすごく嬉しかった◝(●˙꒳​˙●)◜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね、この衣装気に入って\nジャケットの中の黒衿のてろっとした白のシャツを\nお買い上げしたんだよヽ(•̀ω•́ )ゝ✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度写真載せるね‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、ここでクイズーー✰"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真でも食べてる\nチュッパチャプスは、何味でしょー⁇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡ヒント♡\nちはるが1番好きなあじ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ(´>∀<｀)ゝ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを今回の質問にしちゃおっと←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問の答えで、\n無理しない程度でやってほしい‼\nっていう声が多かったので\nやっちゃおっかな⁇ヽ(•̀ω•́ )ゝ✧"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、記念すべき1人目はー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはね、\n同い年だし共感することとか多いかも‼\n乃木坂のこともそうだけど、\n学校とか勉強のことも‼\nこーゆー真剣な話もできる大切なひめたん♡♡\nでも普段はふざけあってるんだよー\nおい中元ーなんだ斎藤ー\nみたいなね。ねねね。\nてかなによりもひめたんのダンスとか\nひめたんのアイドル意識とかに尊敬する‼\nすごいよすごいよ(´Д` )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも生田どんと一緒に\nいたいこりずみかる中３ほねほね同盟でがんばろな‼\nいたいこ→いたい。\nりずみかる→なぜかりずみかる。\n中３→永遠の中３。大学生でも中３。\nほねほね→ほねほねになりたい。\nこれはみんなに秘密にしとこゆわれたのに\nゆっちゃった(*´艸`)てへぺろ\n実をゆうとねー、いたいこ中３ほねほけ同盟のみんなは\nメアドが似てたりする‼\nわざとよわざとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふヽ(^ω^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなひめたんが大好き‼◝(●˙꒳​˙●)◜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん。思ったより長くなったー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆことで第１回目はひめたんでしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/02/9399025/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次回からも楽しみにしとって‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もいっぱい踊ったなヽ(^0^)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るんるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪♪(o・ω・)ノ))"}],"source":"archive"}